<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sayonara Baby"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Miliyah"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537404923"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">为你炽热的目光所吸引</text><text for="L2">坠入爱河的那一瞬间</text><text for="L3">便笃信这就是命中注定</text><text for="L4">我一定</text><text for="L5">是为了与你相遇</text><text for="L6">才降生在这个世上</text><text for="L7">明明曾经那样深信不疑</text><text for="L8">时间分明已悄然流逝 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(早已 流逝)</span></text><text for="L9">你却依然笼罩在重重谜团中</text><text for="L10">面对询问只有含糊的回答 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(提问)</span></text><text for="L11">关于你的一切我其实一无所知</text><text for="L12">「再见」</text><text for="L13">『才不准你说出口』</text><text for="L14">「骗你的 陪在我身边」</text><text for="L15">『我永远不会放开你』</text><text for="L16">「你爱我吗？」</text><text for="L17">『啊 我爱你啊』</text><text for="L18">「我可以相信你吗？」</text><text for="L19">『喜欢你呀 快到我怀里来』</text><text for="L20">「好寂寞」</text><text for="L21">『我现在很忙』</text><text for="L22">「待会儿打给我」</text><text for="L23">『一定会打给你的 等着我』</text><text for="L24">「求求你了」</text><text for="L25">『今晚我去找你』</text><text for="L26">「终于能见到你了」</text><text for="L27">『我也想见你 无论何时』</text><text for="L28">明明渴望有所改变</text><text for="L29">我却依然没有任何改变</text><text for="L30">你说的那句我爱你</text><text for="L31">每一次听你提起</text><text for="L32">虽然我都选择去相信</text><text for="L33">这段关系却满是疑虑</text><text for="L34">明明想要就此分手</text><text for="L35">却怎么也无法分开</text><text for="L36">苦恼得什么都咽不下去</text><text for="L37">一直装作未曾察觉 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(察觉 假装)</span></text><text for="L38">你的手机总是上了锁</text><text for="L39">却极少接听我的电话 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(我的)</span></text><text for="L40">明明十分介意 可是</text><text for="L41">这种事我又怎么问得出口</text><text for="L42">「好想见你」</text><text for="L43">『我也想见你』</text><text for="L44">「真的吗？不是在骗我吧？」</text><text for="L45">『我的心里只有你一个人』</text><text for="L46">「我真的撑不下去了」</text><text for="L47">『才没有撑不下去』</text><text for="L48">「我一直都相信着你」</text><text for="L49">『我爱的人 只有你一个』</text><text for="L50">「你现在在哪？」</text><text for="L51">『突然怎么了？』</text><text for="L52">「你在想些什么呢？」</text><text for="L53">『我心里一直都在想着你啊』</text><text for="L54">「骗子」</text><text for="L55">『我才没有骗你』</text><text for="L56">「对我说你爱我」</text><text for="L57">『我深爱着你 如此深刻』</text><text for="L58">不过是在一次次重复虚伪的对白</text><text for="L59">这样真的好吗？</text><text for="L60">怎么可能会好啊</text><text for="L61">我根本一点都没有被爱着</text><text for="L62">今天依然说不出口</text><text for="L63">可是我好想说出来</text><text for="L64">再见了宝贝 真的好痛苦</text><text for="L65">「再见吧」</text><text for="L66">『我不准你说出口』</text><text for="L67">「骗你的 留在我身边」</text><text for="L68">『我绝不会放开你』</text><text for="L69">「你还爱我吗？」</text><text for="L70">『嗯 我当然深爱着你』</text><text for="L71">「我真的能相信你吗？」</text><text for="L72">『喜欢你啊 快到我身边来』</text><text for="L73">「我想见你」</text><text for="L74">『我也好想见你』</text><text for="L75">「是真的吗？没有骗我？」</text><text for="L76">『除了你我身边再无他人』</text><text for="L77">「我再也撑不下去了」</text><text for="L78">『不 怎么会撑不下去』</text><text for="L79">「我永远都相信着你」</text><text for="L80">『我爱的 唯有你一人』</text><text for="L81">明明心里全都明白</text><text for="L82">却终究还是说不出再见</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:09.918"><div begin="0:26.432" end="4:09.918"><p begin="0:26.432" end="0:29.092" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.432" end="0:26.782">熱</span><span begin="0:26.782" end="0:27.012">い視</span><span begin="0:27.012" end="0:27.572">線</span><span begin="0:27.642" end="0:27.892">に</span><span begin="0:28.132" end="0:28.712">導</span><span begin="0:28.712" end="0:28.872">か</span><span begin="0:28.872" end="0:29.092">れ</span></p><p begin="0:29.092" end="0:31.542" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.092" end="0:29.572">恋</span><span begin="0:29.572" end="0:29.862">に</span><span begin="0:30.152" end="0:30.322">落</span><span begin="0:30.322" end="0:30.602">ち</span><span begin="0:30.602" end="0:30.712">た</span><span begin="0:30.712" end="0:31.092">瞬</span><span begin="0:31.092" end="0:31.542">間</span></p><p begin="0:31.657" end="0:34.347" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.657" end="0:32.347">運</span><span begin="0:32.347" end="0:32.877">命</span><span begin="0:32.877" end="0:33.077">だ</span><span begin="0:33.077" end="0:33.337">と</span><span begin="0:33.337" end="0:33.867">感</span><span begin="0:33.867" end="0:34.117">じ</span><span begin="0:34.117" end="0:34.347">た</span></p><p begin="0:34.339" end="0:35.869" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.339" end="0:34.889">私</span><span begin="0:34.889" end="0:35.099">は</span><span begin="0:35.099" end="0:35.449">きっ</span><span begin="0:35.609" end="0:35.869">と</span></p><p begin="0:36.174" end="0:37.874" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:36.174" end="0:36.324">あ</span><span begin="0:36.324" end="0:36.604">な</span><span begin="0:36.604" end="0:36.744">た</span><span begin="0:36.744" end="0:36.894">に</span><span begin="0:36.894" end="0:37.094">会う</span><span begin="0:37.094" end="0:37.474">た</span><span begin="0:37.634" end="0:37.874">め</span></p><p begin="0:38.160" end="0:39.410" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.160" end="0:38.320">生</span><span begin="0:38.320" end="0:38.620">ま</span><span begin="0:38.620" end="0:38.720">れ</span><span begin="0:38.720" end="0:39.150">たん</span><span begin="0:39.150" end="0:39.410">だ</span></p><p begin="0:39.626" end="0:42.336" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:39.626" end="0:40.336">本</span><span begin="0:40.336" end="0:40.616">気</span><span begin="0:40.616" end="0:40.766">で</span><span begin="0:40.766" end="0:41.136">そう</span><span begin="0:41.136" end="0:41.586">思っ</span><span begin="0:41.586" end="0:41.796">た</span><span begin="0:41.796" end="0:42.096">の</span><span begin="0:42.096" end="0:42.336">に</span></p><p begin="0:42.334" end="0:46.114" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:42.098" end="0:42.557">(もう</span> <span begin="0:44.114" end="0:44.844">流)</span></span><span begin="0:42.814" end="0:43.064">時</span><span begin="0:43.064" end="0:43.574">間</span><span begin="0:43.574" end="0:44.114">は</span> <span begin="0:44.844" end="0:45.054">れ</span><span begin="0:45.054" end="0:45.514">た</span><span begin="0:45.514" end="0:45.874">の</span><span begin="0:45.874" end="0:46.114">に</span></p><p begin="0:46.115" end="0:50.325" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:46.115" end="0:46.255">あ</span><span begin="0:46.255" end="0:46.585">な</span><span begin="0:46.585" end="0:46.855">た</span><span begin="0:46.855" end="0:47.095">は</span><span begin="0:47.095" end="0:47.355">ま</span><span begin="0:47.355" end="0:47.605">だ</span><span begin="0:47.855" end="0:48.335">謎</span><span begin="0:48.335" end="0:48.605">に</span><span begin="0:48.605" end="0:48.855">包</span><span begin="0:48.855" end="0:49.115">ま</span><span begin="0:49.115" end="0:49.315">れ</span><span begin="0:49.315" end="0:49.495">た</span><span begin="0:49.495" end="0:49.855">ま</span><span begin="0:49.855" end="0:50.325">ま</span></p><p begin="0:50.331" end="0:53.901" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="0:50.331" end="0:50.841">(質)</span></span><span begin="0:50.841" end="0:51.101">問</span><span begin="0:51.101" end="0:51.501">に</span><span begin="0:51.501" end="0:51.891">は</span><span begin="0:52.141" end="0:52.331">曖</span><span begin="0:52.331" end="0:52.871">昧</span><span begin="0:52.871" end="0:53.181">な</span><span begin="0:53.181" end="0:53.531">An</span><span begin="0:53.531" end="0:53.901">swer</span></p><p begin="0:54.153" end="0:58.223" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:54.153" end="0:54.283">あ</span><span begin="0:54.283" end="0:54.583">な</span><span begin="0:54.583" end="0:54.693">た</span><span begin="0:54.693" end="0:54.833">の</span><span begin="0:54.833" end="0:55.083">こ</span><span begin="0:55.083" end="0:55.243">と</span><span begin="0:55.243" end="0:55.423">を</span><span begin="0:55.593" end="0:56.133">私</span><span begin="0:56.133" end="0:56.323">は</span><span begin="0:56.323" end="0:56.823">何</span><span begin="0:56.823" end="0:57.073">も</span><span begin="0:57.073" end="0:57.303">知</span><span begin="0:57.303" end="0:57.833">ら</span><span begin="0:57.833" end="0:58.223">ない</span></p><p begin="0:58.229" end="0:59.509" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:58.229" end="0:58.629">「サ</span><span begin="0:58.629" end="0:58.859">ヨ</span><span begin="0:58.859" end="0:59.079">ナ</span><span begin="0:59.079" end="0:59.509">ラ」</span></p><p begin="0:59.670" end="1:01.500" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="0:59.670" end="0:59.840">『い</span><span begin="0:59.840" end="1:00.110">や</span><span begin="1:00.110" end="1:00.330">言</span><span begin="1:00.330" end="1:00.570">わ</span><span begin="1:00.570" end="1:00.850">せ</span><span begin="1:00.850" end="1:01.120">な</span><span begin="1:01.120" end="1:01.500">い』</span></p><p begin="1:01.648" end="1:03.678" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.648" end="1:02.098">「嘘</span><span begin="1:02.098" end="1:02.328">よ</span><span begin="1:02.328" end="1:02.868">傍</span><span begin="1:02.868" end="1:03.108">に</span><span begin="1:03.108" end="1:03.348">い</span><span begin="1:03.348" end="1:03.678">て」</span></p><p begin="1:03.684" end="1:06.404" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:03.684" end="1:04.134">『君</span><span begin="1:04.134" end="1:04.344">を</span><span begin="1:04.344" end="1:04.844">ずっ</span><span begin="1:04.844" end="1:05.074">と</span><span begin="1:05.074" end="1:05.554">離</span><span begin="1:05.554" end="1:05.824">さ</span><span begin="1:05.824" end="1:06.154">な</span><span begin="1:06.154" end="1:06.404">い』</span></p><p begin="1:06.399" end="1:07.419" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.399" end="1:06.579">「愛</span><span begin="1:06.579" end="1:06.799">し</span><span begin="1:06.799" end="1:07.159">て</span><span begin="1:07.159" end="1:07.419">る？」</span></p><p begin="1:07.673" end="1:09.473" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:07.673" end="1:07.923">『ああ</span> <span begin="1:07.923" end="1:08.293">愛</span><span begin="1:08.293" end="1:08.583">し</span><span begin="1:08.583" end="1:08.873">て</span><span begin="1:08.873" end="1:09.123">る</span><span begin="1:09.123" end="1:09.473">よ』</span></p><p begin="1:09.483" end="1:11.723" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.483" end="1:10.093">「信</span><span begin="1:10.093" end="1:10.343">じ</span><span begin="1:10.343" end="1:10.603">て</span><span begin="1:10.603" end="1:10.863">も</span><span begin="1:10.863" end="1:11.343">いい</span><span begin="1:11.343" end="1:11.723">の？」</span></p><p begin="1:11.731" end="1:15.256" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:11.731" end="1:12.061">『好</span><span begin="1:12.061" end="1:12.381">き</span><span begin="1:12.381" end="1:12.591">だ</span><span begin="1:12.591" end="1:12.821">よ</span> <span begin="1:12.821" end="1:13.091">こっ</span><span begin="1:13.091" end="1:13.381">ち</span><span begin="1:13.381" end="1:13.651">お</span><span begin="1:13.651" end="1:13.851">い</span><span begin="1:13.851" end="1:14.091">で</span><span begin="1:14.091" end="1:15.256">よ』</span></p><p begin="1:14.218" end="1:15.468" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.218" end="1:14.778">「寂</span><span begin="1:14.778" e